---
config:
  handDrawnSeed: 7

---
stateDiagram-v2
    classDef big font-size:20px,font-style:italic
    classDef fam font-family:verdana,font-weight:600
    A : a label that is long enough to pass the minimum width
    B : another label that is long enough to pass the minimum
    C : plain label that is long enough to pass the minimum
    class A big
    class B fam
    A --> B
    B --> C
    style C font-weight:500,font-size:17px
    D : title
    D : description line
    class D big
    C --> D
